      "headline": "US completes withdrawal from Erbil, ending 23-year presence and 12-year anti-ISIS mission",
      "detail": "US and coalition forces completed orderly departure of troops and equipment from Erbil Air Base on September 30, 2026, ending Operation Inherent Resolve's mission in Iraq. The departure ends a 23-year US presence since 2003 and a 12-year anti-ISIS mission since 2014. CJTF-OIR remains operational headquartered in Jordan with hundreds of US troops continuing counter-ISIS operations in Syria.",
